cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Groundwork or the Personal-Memory-RGB benchmark, please cite this repository."
title: "Groundwork: Calibrated Grounding for On-Device Browser Agents"
abstract: >-
  Groundwork is a privacy-first, local-first agentic browser assistant (Chrome MV3
  extension) with fine-tuned small local models unified by a "calibrated grounding"
  objective: act only on what is on the page, answer only from what was read, and
  abstain/defer under uncertainty. It includes Personal-Memory-RGB, a benchmark for
  grounded QA + calibrated refusal over a user's own browsing history.
type: software
